# Tannuk, Memorial Ensign {1}{R}{G} 2/4: "Landfall - Whenever a land you control enters, Tannuk deals 1 damage to each opponent. If this is the second time this ability has resolved this turn, draw a card." On turn 1 Bot1 casts
